// roboscope camera Pi: what unattended-upgrades may install.
// Deployed from the roboscope repo (hardware/camera_pi/rootfs); edit it there, not on the Pi.
//
// The stock 50unattended-upgrades only matches origin=Debian. This 32-bit Pi OS pulls from
// origin=Raspbian (raspbian.raspberrypi.com) and origin="Raspberry Pi Foundation"
// (archive.raspberrypi.com), so the stock config upgrades nothing. Raspbian has no
// separate security suite, so allow all of the stable release from both origins.
// Checked with `apt-cache policy` on 2026-11-25. This file is read after 50-, and list
// entries are appended to the stock ones.
//
// No automatic reboot: a reboot mid-observation would drop the camera. Check for
// /var/run/reboot-required and reboot by hand between sessions.
Unattended-Upgrade::Origins-Pattern {
        "origin=Raspbian,codename=${distro_codename},label=Raspbian";
        "origin=Raspberry Pi Foundation,codename=${distro_codename},label=Raspberry Pi Foundation";
};
Unattended-Upgrade::Automatic-Reboot "false";
